"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"Once everything is set up, the host will need to go to the room you'll be using for your Archipelago session on the Archipelago website. Once you have the room, you'll need click the 'Download Patch File' next to your name.\n\nAfter it is downloaded, double click to open the patch file (.apemerald), it will automatically open the AP Launcher and it will ask you to select your ROM and then 'EmuHawk.exe'.\n\nIn the 'AP address' field, enter archipelago.gg: followed by the port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after creating a new room.\n\nIt should open the emulator with the modded ROM and also connect you to a text client! You can now start playing!",
